        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "07f712e8-4c74-36a5-8c07-0952cfa6a137",
                "word": "thyrse",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec5c2e45-ba04-44da-8936-6da084acc856",
                        "entry_id": "07f712e8-4c74-36a5-8c07-0952cfa6a137",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "thyrses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dea84717-be88-3d9b-a743-e7675e3dccf2",
                        "entry_id": "07f712e8-4c74-36a5-8c07-0952cfa6a137",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of inflorescence; a compact panicle having an obscured main axis and cymose subaxes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e8dd12c-3190-4409-9e8d-b77127efc0ad",
                                "sense_id": "dea84717-be88-3d9b-a743-e7675e3dccf2",
                                "text": "The Thyrsus *, or Thyrse, is a mode of inflorescence very nearly allied to the panicle, being, in fact, a panicle contracted into an ovate, or egg-shaped form. In the thyrse, the middle footstalks, which are longer, extend horizontally, whilst the upper and lower oes are shorter, and rise up vertically."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d40eca0-6222-4fd7-a190-4fdd238cb02b",
                                "sense_id": "dea84717-be88-3d9b-a743-e7675e3dccf2",
                                "text": "The example of the thyrse of Eugenia leads us to understand several inflorescences which resemble also racemes or panicles; such are the thyrses of the Lilac."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10d4e969-363f-4623-8868-f99b0bd2cd02",
                                "sense_id": "dea84717-be88-3d9b-a743-e7675e3dccf2",
                                "text": "1998, D. W. Stevenson, M. Colella, B. Boom, Rapateaceae, Klaus Kubitzki, H. Huber (editors), The Families and Genera of Vascular Plants, Volume IV: Flowering Plants, Monocotyledons: Alismatanae and Commelinanae (except Gramineae), page 417,\nThe number of spikelets is variable, and some genera have thyrses with 70 spikelets (Saxofridericia, Spathanthus) or only 1-3 spikelets per inflorescence (Stegolepsis, Monotrema)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8df86f1e-4599-3c4f-8a76-afcf7dc618f3",
                        "entry_id": "07f712e8-4c74-36a5-8c07-0952cfa6a137",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A thyrsus (staff with conical ornament)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03b241d6-60ea-46c9-a234-b81319850e59",
                        "source_entry_id": "07f712e8-4c74-36a5-8c07-0952cfa6a137",
                        "source_sense_description": "type of inflorescence",
                        "target_lang_word": "thyrse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thyrse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5978eca-a20e-37f2-b288-dd0a1e35da05",
                                        "entry_id": "00f78c74-1414-3bb7-b8e3-9bea8dc614ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bâton, lance ou javelot entouré de pampre et de lierre, terminé par une pomme de pin ou des feuilles de vigne, parfois enrubanné, et dont les bacchantes étaient armées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "191681bf-2d24-4ac9-ab67-bc806a1cbac3",
                                                "sense_id": "b5978eca-a20e-37f2-b288-dd0a1e35da05",
                                                "text": "Deux candélabres, formés par une bacchante debout, portant un thyrse qui se divise en trois branches torses portant des binets, reliées par des feuilles de lierre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c16862f-ac86-48f0-9996-1186587930dd",
                                                "sense_id": "b5978eca-a20e-37f2-b288-dd0a1e35da05",
                                                "text": "La terre retentit du galop des centaures ;\nIl en venait du fond de l’horizon sonore,\nEt l’on voyait, assis sur la croupe qui rue,\nTenant des thyrses tors et des outres ventrues,\nDes satyres boiteux piqués par des abeilles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60207031-da75-4900-95d4-490d0ab2c6b2",
                                                "sense_id": "b5978eca-a20e-37f2-b288-dd0a1e35da05",
                                                "text": "À droite du satyre se trouve Dionysos, qui tient un canthare et un thyrse […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03cea518-0ba4-3b2d-b0d8-e1e680acd4d8",
                                        "entry_id": "00f78c74-1414-3bb7-b8e3-9bea8dc614ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Élément végétal décoratif, propre en particulier au style Louis XVI."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                        "entry_id": "00f78c74-1414-3bb7-b8e3-9bea8dc614ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inflorescence pyramidale composée de grappes de cymes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cfb9b89-ee9f-410a-b784-ed9a5de3edd2",
                                                "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                                "text": "Le thyrse de la vigne, du lilas, du marronnier, etc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02993e62-9cd9-4b72-9e54-2f11fed4018e",
                                                "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                                "text": "Chaque maison a son jardin rempli de fleurs et ombragé de marronniers aux thyrses roses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8db54d35-b802-4a4d-97df-f1d2fc7e28b1",
                                                "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                                "text": "Les thyrses des ajoncs bordaient les talus des chemins creux, en attendant les thyrses des aubépines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65027b1b-df9c-4fe2-88b8-254ffb1cd8dc",
                                                "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                                "text": "Quand nous longions des jardins, nous voyions les thyrses des lilas rougir au milieu de la verdure tendre du feuillage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a965d5c2-d394-41d0-b873-3d865d9af317",
                                                "sense_id": "8b200f6f-6fba-3e36-815b-1d4a0de2e885",
                                                "text": "Après que les genêts auraient perdu leurs fleurs, les grandes digitales fleuriraient, aligneraient le long des haies, dans l’ombre humide des fossés, leurs thyrses de clochettes écarlates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
